# Local-group presence by city/region, from the Atmosphere, Mozilla and
# IndieWebCamps community directories.
#
# ex:Location is the place (city, area or country); one ex:LocalGroup
# per group there. The groups carry their own ex:sdo, so a location can
# host several standards bodies and the UI derives its SDO icon list from
# the groups present. Locations with an event but no group yet have no
# SDO icons; events link to them with ex:atLocation.
#
# Sources:
#   https://atmosphere.community/communities
#   https://community.mozilla.org/en/groups/
#   https://indieweb.org/IndieWebCamps
#   https://www.w3.org/events/
#   https://www.w3.org/news-events/ac/2027/
#   https://sosy2027.org/
# Seeded with `devbox run seed` (see devbox.json).

@prefix ex: <http://example.org#> .

